Cell["\<\
TEST ONE SINGLE TRACK AND ITS CHERENKOV PHOTONS AT FIXED AZIMUTH\
\>", "Section",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.945862080410919*^9, {3.987675313095888*^9, 
